              pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Alloy
chips:Alloy rdf:type owl:Class ;
            rdfs:subClassOf chips:Metal ;
            rdfs:label "Alloy"@en ;
            skos:definition "An alloy is a metal material composed of two or more metallic or metalloid elements combined to achieve properties such as increased strength, corrosion resistance, or specific melting points compared to pure metals."@en ;
            pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Alloying
