                 pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Ambient_Pressure_Xray_Photoelectron_Spectroscopy
chips:Ambient_Pressure_Xray_Photoelectron_Spectroscopy rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                       rdfs:subClassOf mo:Xray_Photoelectron_Spectroscopy ,
