                               pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Biology
chips:Biology rdf:type owl:Class ;
              rdfs:subClassOf chips:Domain_Activities ;
