                            skos:definition "Checkpoint Technology is a semiconductor metrology and inspection company that provides process control solutions including optical and X-ray metrology systems for semiconductor manufacturing."@en ;
                            pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Chelating_Ligands
chips:Chelating_Ligands rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        owl:equivalentClass chips:Functionalized_Nanoparticle_Trap ;
