                      pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Design_Process
chips:Design_Process rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Prozess ,
                                     [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                       owl:onProperty prov:generated ;
                                       owl:someValuesFrom chips:Design_Document
                                     ] ,
