                 rdfs:label "Dispersion"@en ;
                 skos:definition "Dispersion is a mathematical concept describing the spreading or separation of a distribution, whether of wave velocities across frequencies, particles across sizes, or values across a statistical population, due to differential behavior of its components."@en ;
                 pmdco:definitionSource "claude-opus-4-6"@en .


