                 rdfs:label "Equivalence"@en ;
                 skos:definition "Equivalence is a mathematical concept that represents a relationship between two or more quantities or entities that are equal in value, measure, or effect within a defined context or transformation."@en ;
                 pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


