                                 rdfs:label "Finite Difference Software"@en ;
                                 skos:definition "Finite Difference Software is a software agent that implements finite difference numerical schemes to solve partial differential equations describing continuum physical phenomena such as electromagnetism or heat conduction."@en ;
                                 pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Finite_Element_Analysis
