            pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Intelligence_Advanced_Research_Projects_Activity
chips:Intelligence_Advanced_Research_Projects_Activity rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                       rdfs:subClassOf chips:Intelligence_Agency ,
                                                                       [ owl:intersectionOf ( [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
