          pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Ion_Exchange
chips:Ion_Exchange rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf chips:Filtration_Process ;
                   rdfs:label "Ion Exchange"@en ;
                   skos:definition "Ion Exchange is a filtration process in which ions in a solution are replaced by ions of the same charge from an ion exchange resin, used for water purification and analyte preconcentration."@en ;
                   pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Ion_Image
