           rdfs:label "Mean"@en ;
           skos:altLabel "Average"@en ;
           skos:definition "The mean is a statistical concept representing the arithmetic average of a set of values, calculated by summing all observations and dividing by their count, used as a measure of central tendency for a distribution."@en ;
           pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Mean_Free_Path
chips:Mean_Free_Path rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf chips:Physical_Property ,
