                     pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Neutron
chips:Neutron rdf:type owl:Class ;
              rdfs:subClassOf chips:Particle ;
              rdfs:label "Neutron"@en ;
              skos:definition "A neutron is an electrically neutral subatomic particle found in atomic nuclei, used as a probe in neutron scattering and neutron activation analysis for bulk materials characterization."@en ;
              pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Neutron_Beam
