###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Nuclear_Magnetic_Resonance
chips:Nuclear_Magnetic_Resonance rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf chips:Resonanant_Process ,
