                                     pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Orbitalpolarized_Neutron_Beam
chips:Orbitalpolarized_Neutron_Beam rdf:type owl:Class ;
