                                         owl:someValuesFrom chips:Raman_Microscopy
                                       ] ;
                       rdfs:label "Raman Microscope"@en ;
                       skos:definition "Raman Microscope is a confocal optical instrument that focuses a laser beam on a specimen through a microscope objective and collects spatially resolved Raman spectra to map chemical composition and molecular structure."@en ;
                       pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Raman_Microscopy
