                         rdfs:label "Raman Spectrometer"@en ;
                         skos:definition "Raman Spectrometer is an optical spectrometer that measures the inelastic scattering of monochromatic laser light by a specimen to record its Raman spectrum, revealing molecular vibrational modes and chemical identity."@en ;
                         pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Raman_Spectroscopy
