                        pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Rigaku
chips:Rigaku rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Hersteller ;
             rdfs:label "Rigaku"@en ;
             skos:definition "Rigaku is a scientific instruments company that manufactures X-ray diffraction, X-ray fluorescence, and small-angle X-ray scattering instruments for materials characterization in research and industrial settings."@en ;
