                    skos:definition "Robotic Agent is a process node comprising an autonomous or semi-autonomous mechanical system that performs physical tasks—such as specimen handling, dispensing, or positioning—under computer control."@en ;
                    pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


