                                       owl:someValuesFrom pmdco:Metadaten
                                     ] ;
                     rdfs:label "State Variable"@en ;
                     skos:definition "State Variable is an independent variable that defines the thermodynamic or physical state of a system, such as temperature, pressure, or composition, from which all other equilibrium properties can be derived."@en ;
                     pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Statistical_Analysis
