                                                       rdfs:label "Surface-enhanced Infrared Absorption Spectroscopy"@en ;
                                                       skos:definition "Surface-Enhanced Infrared Absorption Spectroscopy (SEIRAS) is a technique that amplifies the infrared absorption signal of molecules adsorbed on a metallic nanostructured surface by orders of magnitude, enabling monolayer-level chemical detection."@en ;
