                         pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/Thermal_Spectroscopy
chips:Thermal_Spectroscopy rdf:type owl:Class ;
                           rdfs:subClassOf mo:Spectroscopy ;
