                                                     skos:definition "7-ID (SST-1) is the Soft X-ray Scattering and Spectroscopy beamline 1 at the National Synchrotron Light Source II (NSLS-II) at Brookhaven National Laboratory, providing tender and soft X-rays for resonant scattering and spectroscopy of polymer, biological, and electronic materials."@en ;
                                                     pmdco:definitionSource "claude-sonnet-4-6"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/7ID_SST2
<https://w3id.org/CHIPS/metrology-ontology/7ID_SST2> rdf:type owl:Class ;
