                                            "Qualifying Node Annotation"@en ;
                                 skos:definition "Description for Processing Node's utility, e.g. \"Rear Vacuum Furnace Oil Quenching\""@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Querschnittsflche
pmdco:Querschnittsflche rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Flche ;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                        rdfs:label "Cross Section Area"@en ,
                                   "Querschnittsfläche"@de ;
                        skos:definition "Diese Eigenschaft beschreibt die Fläche eines Schnittes oder eines rechtwinklig geschnittenen oder gebrochenen Stücks eines Objektes in Bezug auf eine Achse."@de ,
                                        "This property describes the area of a cutting or piece of an object cut off or broken at right angles or related to an axis."@en ;
                        pmdco:definitionSource "https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/cross%20section"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Radiological_Property
pmdco:Radiological_Property rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            rdfs:subClassOf chips:Physical_Property ;
                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                            rdfs:label "Radiological Property"@en ,
                                       "Radiologisch"@de ;
                            skos:definition "A radiological property is a physical property that characterizes how a material interacts with ionizing radiation, including absorption coefficients, scattering cross-sections, and radioactive decay rates."@en ;
                            pmdco:definitionSource "“Radiological.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/radiological. Accessed 13 Jan. 2023."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Radius
pmdco:Radius rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Lnge ;
             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
             rdfs:label "Radius"@de ,
                        "Radius"@en ;
             skos:definition "A line segment extending from the center of a circle or sphere to the circumference or bounding surface."@en ;
             pmdco:definitionSource "“Radius.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/radius. Accessed 5 Dec. 2022."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Rechteckig
pmdco:Rechteckig rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Form ;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                 rdfs:label "Rechteckig"@de ,
                            "Rectangular"@en ;
                 skos:definition "Geformt wie ein Rechteck."@de ,
                                 "Shaped like a rectangle."@en ;
                 pmdco:definitionSource "“Rectangular.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/rectangular. Accessed 13 Jan. 2023."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Region_of_Interest
pmdco:Region_of_Interest rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Datenkategorie ;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                         rdfs:label "Betrachteter Bereich"@de ,
                                    "Region of Interest"@en ;
                         skos:definition """Some region of interest (ROI) in an image. Describe the ROI by use of Web Annotation Vocabulary (https://www.w3.org/TR/annotation-vocab/). The ROI is understood as the target of a (body-less) annotation. 

The web annotation model suggests the use of different fragment specifications (https://www.w3.org/TR/annotation-model/#fragment-selector), however we suggest to prefer media fragments (https://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/)."""@en ;
                         skos:example """:image1  a pmd:Image
:roi1 a pmd:RegionOfInterest .
:roi1 oa:hasSource :image1 ;
         oa:hasSelector [
            a oa:FragmentSelector ;
            dcterms:conformsTo <http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/> ;
            rdf:value \"xywh=160,120,320,240\" ] ] .""" .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Regression
pmdco:Regression rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf chips:Prediction_Process ;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                 rdfs:label "Regression"@de ,
                            "Regression"@en ;
                 skos:definition """A functional relationship between two or more correlated variables that is often empirically determined from data and is used especially to predict values of one variable when given values of the others.
Specifically : a function that yields the mean value of a random variable under the condition that one or more independent variables have specified values."""@en ;
                 skos:example "Regression of y on x is linear"@en ;
                 pmdco:definitionSource "“Regression.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/regression. Accessed 24 Nov. 2022."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Related_Project_Identifier
pmdco:Related_Project_Identifier rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Identifikator ;
                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                                 rdfs:label "Identifikation Eines Verbundenen Projektes"@de ,
                                            "Related Project Identifier"@en ;
                                 skos:definition "Diese Eigenschaft beschreibt einen benannten Wert, der dazu dient, zwischen Projekten zu unterscheiden, die mit dem betrachteten Projekt in Relation stehen. Zwei in Relation stehende Projekte könnten zum Beispiel ein Messprojekt sein, das Teil eines Projekts mit einem breiteren Betrachtungsbereich ist."@de ,
                                                 "This property describes a named value intended to distinguish between projects that are related to the project considered. For instance, two related projects could be a measurement project that is part of project with a broader scope."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Retortentyp
pmdco:Retortentyp rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Ofencharakteristik ;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                  rdfs:label "Retort Type"@en ,
                             "Retortentyp"@de ;
                  skos:definition "Geometry and and orientation of the inner system boundaries of the heat treatment processing node."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Rohling
pmdco:Rohling rdf:type owl:Class ;
              rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Engineered_Material ;
              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
              rdfs:label "Blank"@en ,
                         "Rohling"@de ;
              skos:definition "A piece of material prepared to be made into something by a further operation."@en ;
              pmdco:definitionSource "“Blank.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/blank. Accessed 25 Nov. 2022."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Sekundrdaten
pmdco:Sekundrdaten rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf chips:Data ,
                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                     owl:onProperty pmdco:output_of ;
                                     owl:someValuesFrom chips:Derived_Process
                                   ] ;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                   rdfs:label "Secondary Data"@en ,
                              "Sekundärdaten"@de ;
                   skos:definition "Der Datenkategorie Sekundärdaten umfasst Werte (z. B. Testergebnisse), die durch Gleichungen oder Algorithmen unter Verwendung von Primärdaten und Metadaten ermittelt werden."@de ,
                                   "This data scope expresses that a ValueObject refers to characteristic values (e.g. test results) determined by equations or algorithms using primary data and/or metadata."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Semikristalline_Struktur
pmdco:Semikristalline_Struktur rdf:type owl:Class ;
                               rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Materialstruktur ;
                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                               rdfs:label "Semi Crystalline Structure"@en ,
                                          "Semikristalline Struktur"@de ;
                               skos:definition "Feststoffe, die eine teilkristalline Struktur aufweisen, enthalten sowohl kristalline als auch amorphe Bereiche (Domänen). Kristalline Stoffe, die keine Einkristalle, sondern Polykristalle sind, werden nicht als teilkristallin bezeichnet, auch wenn sich zwischen den Kristalliten ein dünner amorpher Film befindet."@de ,
                                               "Solid materials exhibiting a semi-crystalline structure contain both crystalline and amorphous sections (domains). Crystalline substances that are polycrystals rather than single crystals are not designated as semicrystalline, even if there is a thin amorphous film between the crystallites."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Sequenznummer
pmdco:Sequenznummer rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf pmdco:Identifikator ;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/co> ;
                    rdfs:label "Sequence Number"@en ,
                               "Sequenznummer"@de ;
                    skos:definition "Strict monotonically increasing integer that indicates the position in an ordered list."@en .


